OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a fine
OL,6,Fend to the day, it will remain dry
OL,7,Fwith clear spells overnight. Light
OL,8,Fwinds throughout. Turning chilly,
OL,9,Fespecially in some rural spots.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA dry and bright but mostly
OL,12,Fcloudy day. Cloud will thicken into
OL,13,Fthe evening as outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fspread eastward on a freshening breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
