OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing, then mostly dry Friday
OL,7,Fwith the odd shower possible. Rain
OL,8,Fspreading in late on Saturday. Cloudy
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of rain Sunday.
OL,10,FTemperatures trending a little above
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
